      "answer": 3,
      "explain": "每一位一组，64 位即 64 组。"
    },
    {
      "id": "q05",
      "chapterId": "ch02",
      "type": "single",
      "question": "四 Russians 方法中，n 个变量切成每块 k 个，预计算规模约为 (n/k) 乘以多少？",
      "options": [
        "2^k",
        "k",
        "n",
        "2^n"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
